# Read the time axis

A periodic signal repeats after one period. Frequency counts how many cycles occur per second. Keep the units visible when you convert between them.

## A simple example

Sketch a repeating wave and mark two neighboring peaks. The time between equivalent points is one period.

**Useful relationship:** f = 1 / T

## Pause and try

Sketch a periodic signal. Label one complete cycle and its period.

